<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="valor-points">
<span class="c11">Valor Points for Feral Druid DPS Phase 4</span></h3>For this Phase there is no longer any Tier available for <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
