<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="feral-druid-dps-in-phase-4">
<span class="c11">Feral Druid DPS in Phase 4</span></h3>Feral Druid DPS enters a world of real viability in Dragon Soul with them scaling from "bad DPS" all the way up to "middle of the pack DPS".<br/>We get <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78473/kiril-fury-of-beasts">
<img alt="Kiril, Fury of Beasts" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/polearm_2h_deathwingraiddw_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Kiril, Fury of Beasts</span></a> which is a powerful weapon with a powerful proc, and we get good high Agility trinkets, access to <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71879/delicate-queens-garnet">
<img alt="Delicate Queen's Garnet" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_epicgem_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Delicate Queen's Garnet</span></a> which means even more Agility. And maybe most important for Feral Druid DPS viability, especially for progression, is the access to 4-piece <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item-set=-499">Tier 13</a>. Although the DPS part of the 4-piece is good, it's the Tank part that will really help out for progression as when you use <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=22842/frenzied-regeneration">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_bullrush.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Frenzied Regeneration</span></a> it will put it on the entire raid as well, quickly turning it into one of if not the strongest raid healing cooldown.<br/>
<br/>When in doubt while gearing Agility is king, but if you're uncertain you can always simulate whichever item using <a href="https://wowsims.github.io/cata/druid/feral/" target="_blank">
<ins>WoWSims</ins></a>.<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="body-armor">Body Armor for Feral Druid DPS</h3>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="head-for-feral-druid-dps">Head for Feral Druid DPS</h4>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78694/deep-earth-headpiece">
<img alt="Deep Earth Headpiece" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_leather_raiddruid_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Deep Earth Headpiece</span></a> is your best available Helm option as a Feral Druid DPS. Even outside of the set bonus, this is your best item for the Helm slot.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Helm Enchant</b>: <a class="q7 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=68766/arcanum-of-the-ramkahen">
<img alt="Arcanum of the Ramkahen" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_fire_masterofelements.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Arcanum of the Ramkahen</span></a>, requires Revered reputation with <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/faction=1173/ramkahen">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Ramkahen</span></a>.<div class="pad"></div>
